    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Stick Mountain</strong>, become an elite <strong>S-Co</strong> agent tasked with eliminating deadly threats across different worlds. Master elemental powers, craft powerful gear, and forge your own path to shape the fate of entire civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Sci-fi Adventure:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become immersed as an S-Co operative who traverses the realms, visiting vastly different and exciting planets and locations!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>An RPG Experience:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own path by choosing how you want to play with a wide variety of characters to play as, equipment to craft, and abilities to level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play With Your Friends (WIP):</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the excitement of Stick Mountain with your friends! Work together to save the realms with up to 6 players at a time!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Yourself:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the difficulty of your character, activate shrines, encounter enemies while exploring, and work through different difficulty modes for each level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a Hero:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show the civilians of the realms your heroism by taking on tasks that no one dares to attempt! Become the greatest hero the realms have ever seen!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go Above and Beyond:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend sacred objects from attackers and survive in order to receive big bonuses!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
